{{!< default}}
{{!-- Template Name: About --}}

<div class="about-page">
  <div class="inner">

    {{#if feature_image}}
    <div class="about-photo">
      <img src="{{img_url feature_image size="l"}}" alt="Shashank R" loading="eager">
    </div>
    {{else}}
    <div class="about-photo">
      <img src="{{asset 'images/avatar.jpg'}}" alt="Shashank R" loading="eager">
    </div>
    {{/if}}

    <div class="about-body">

      <p>Hi. Thanks for being here. I'm Shashank, a digital writer working at the intersection of writing, marketing, and how people show up online. This is my space on the internet where I think, document what I'm learning, and try to make sense of things as I go.</p>

      <h3>Work</h3>

      <p>I didn't start here with a clear plan. I moved to Bangalore after school, studied engineering, and somewhere along the way realised I wasn't building towards something I actually wanted. Writing started as a side thing, a way to make some money, but it slowly became the one thing that kept pulling me back.</p>

      <p>The early years were a mix of trying things, switching directions, and figuring out what fit. I worked across content and marketing roles, spent close to two years at <a href="https://www.thetesttribe.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Test Tribe</a> understanding communities and events, and kept writing consistently through all of it.</p>

      <p>Today, I work at <a href="https://www.growedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GrowedIn</a>, where I help executives and companies build their reputation and presence on LinkedIn. A big part of my work is helping people say what they actually mean, in a way that others can understand and trust.</p>

      <h3>Life</h3>

      <p>Outside of work, things are simple. I prefer a small circle over big crowds. I like spending time with people who feel easy to be around. Most weekends are slow, usually watching movies or shows, sometimes reading, sometimes just switching off.</p>

      <p>I enjoy things that don't ask for too much but still feel fun. Arcades, games, long conversations, that kind of time.</p>

      <h3>This Space</h3>

      <p>The idea didn't start as a website. It started with a simple thought: I wanted a place to put things. Somewhere that felt like my own.</p>

      <p>I'm still a student when it comes to writing. Most of what I share is me trying to understand something better. This is where I keep that, without any fixed schedule, or pressure to be consistent.</p>

      <p>It took me longer than it should have to start this. I kept putting it off, thinking it needed more time, more planning. <a href="https://keyurkumbhare.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keyur</a> kept pushing me for long enough that eventually I just started. Thanks to him. To my surprise this site came together faster than I expected. Built using <a href="https://claude.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude</a>, with <a href="https://ghost.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ghost</a> and <a href="https://www.magicpages.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Magic Pages</a> handling the backend. Kept it simple, and close to how I wanted it to feel. This version went live on 19th April 2026. I'll keep tweaking things as I go.</p>

      <p>This is my little corner on the internet.</p>

      <p>You're always welcome here.</p>

    </div>

